        "title": "的 / 什么: 什么X不X的 dismisses a distinction",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "什么X不X的 dismisses a distinction as irrelevant. It does not genuinely ask whether X is true.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "什么贵不贵的，喜欢就买。",
                "pinyin": "shénme guì bù guì de ， xǐhuan jiù mǎi 。",
                "meaning": "Never mind whether it is expensive; buy it if you like it.",
                "audio": "1c31eb855a3e967b86c58f27998b6d817256415015531ede62eb3f6540c0c875"
              },
              {
                "text": "什么忙不忙的，来就行。",
                "pinyin": "shénme máng bù máng de ， lái jiù xíng 。",
                "meaning": "Never mind being busy; just come.",
                "audio": "06bc16ae91e1302e4ff3d316a715ddfba9b960fc6482939d574f06ce1d373e38"
              }
            ]
